  "prefLabel": "Puc 2603.01 Energy Efficiency for Low Income Residential Customers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 2603.01 Energy Efficiency for Low Income Residential Customers.\n\n(a) Pursuant to RSA 125-O:23, III, the commission shall allocate at least 10 percent of the greenhouse gas emissions reduction fund, on an annual basis to assist low income residential customers:\n\n(1) To reduce total energy use, including heating fuels; and\n\n(2) To foster the development and retrofitting of highly efficient and affordable housing.\n\nSource. #9352, INTERIM, eff 1-1-09; ss by #9615, eff 12-12-09, EXPIRED: 12-12-17",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/puc2600.html"
}
